title: Military Affairs
subtitle: The army: more money, cuts, or the promotion of officers loyal to the government.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_security_rules && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'military_policy') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.military_policy (Z — 1.02, the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026; card catalogue 8.14): three permanent options, as
// the Military Policy of the German original; each takes effect at once and pays from the budget pool (technical reference 11.2).
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'military_policy');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_military');
!}

= Military affairs

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The army answers to the minister of military affairs, but many officers listen above all to Piłsudski. The pressure towards a coup stands at [+ pl_gc_coup_pressure +] of 100; the mood of the officers is described on the State tab.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

- @raise_spending
- @cut_spending
- @promote_officers
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@raise_spending
title: Raise the spending on the army
subtitle: Cost: [+ pl_cost2 +]. The officers are content and the pressure towards a coup falls (−5), but the dissent of the Left of PPS rises (+5).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'military_policy', 'raise_spending').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_military_policy_raise_spending_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'military_policy', 'raise_spending');
!}
go-to: result

@cut_spending
title: Cut the spending on the army
subtitle: Brings the budget 2 units at once. The officers are indignant and the pressure towards a coup rises (+5).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'military_policy', 'cut_spending').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_military_policy_cut_spending_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'military_policy', 'cut_spending');
!}
go-to: result

@promote_officers
title: Promote officers loyal to the government
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget unit. The army leans less towards Piłsudski (−3 percentage points), but relations with Piłsudski worsen (−10) and the Piłsudczycy in PPS protest (+8).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'military_policy', 'promote_officers').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_military_policy_promote_officers_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'military_policy', 'promote_officers');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Military affairs

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
